# `vercel deploy` from the working tree does not read .gitignore. Everything
# here is local-only and must never reach a deployment: credentials, private
# uploads, sample files with real fills, local tooling. Anchored at the root:
# a bare `storage/` would also drop src/lib/storage.
.env*
/storage/
/tmp/
/.claude/
/.vercel/
/coverage/
*.pem
*.tsbuildinfo
